## Scope

This policy covers the code in this repository. If you've found an issue
in a dependency, please report it to that project directly.

## For AI agents working in this repo

If you notice a plausible security issue while working on this codebase,
do not describe it in a public commit message, issue, or PR. Flag it to
the maintainer through the process above instead. See the Governance
section of `AGENTS.md`.
